<div class="toplang">
<p><span>Verf&#252;gbare Sprachen: </span><a href="../de/rewrite/access.html" title="Deutsch">&nbsp;de&nbsp;</a> |
<a href="../en/rewrite/access.html" hreflang="en" rel="alternate" title="English">&nbsp;en&nbsp;</a> |
